[statement]
A package needed both by its name and through a name it provides at a
version is removed last, as one needed through the provided name alone
(`installed/a-package-needed-through-a-name-it-provides-at-a-version-is-removed-last`):
`mesa-egl` needs `mesa=25.2.7-r1` and `so:libgallium-25.2.7.so`, which
`mesa` provides at version 0, and apk removes `read-it-later` before
`mesa`. Needed by name alone, `mesa` goes in the installed database's
order, before `read-it-later`. Reduced from a layered request over Alpine
v3.24 (`read-it-later`'s closure from v3.23 installed, `qbs` asked).

[repository]
P:x
V:1-r0

[installed]
P:mesa
V:25.2.7-r1
p:so:libgallium-25.2.7.so=0

P:mesa-egl
V:25.2.7-r1
D:mesa=25.2.7-r1 so:libgallium-25.2.7.so

P:read-it-later
V:0.6.1-r0

[request]
x

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
remove mesa-egl 25.2.7-r1
remove read-it-later 0.6.1-r0
install x 1-r0
remove mesa 25.2.7-r1
